    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Felix Grisard offsets a loan claim against the Company in the amount of a maximum of CHF 125,000.00, for which he is entitled to a respective number of registered shares of the Company in accordance with the IDC Formula.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
