    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">J&uuml;rgen Bauer offsets an interest claim against the Company in the amount of a maximum of CHF&nbsp;20,138.89, for which he is entitled to a respective number of registered shares of the Company in accordance with the IDC Formula.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
