<TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">4.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The Board of Directors proposes to create a new class of shares (preferred shares) and to add a second paragraph to article 3 of the
Articles as provided in the Invitation.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 5pt; color: Red">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

